# plan-migration — 100% Pure Native Rust + Bevy (3D-First) Master Plan

> **For the agent reading this:** This is the master architecture and execution plan for building the next-generation, commercial-grade **OrlaBlocks** in `/Users/orlandoalmario/Documents/repos/orlablocks-native` using a **100% pure native Rust + Bevy stack (`bevy` + `bevy_egui` + battle-tested geometry/physics crates)**, while keeping this `dungeon_designer` repository completely untouched as the living reference specification.
>
> **Core Rule:** Build iteratively **package by package**, keeping the app **visual and interactive in 3D from Package 2 onward**, and **never reinvent complex engines or computational-geometry algorithms from scratch** when mature, permissively licensed Rust crates exist. Zero npm, zero Node.js, zero WebView/IPC split-brain — one single native binary (`cargo run`) that runs identically on macOS (Metal), Windows (DX12/Vulkan), and Linux (Vulkan).

