  - `orla-app`: Single native binary powered by **Bevy 0.15 (`wgpu`, hardware 32-bit Depth Buffer, 4× MSAA, cascaded directional shadows, hardware depth-tested `Gizmos`, repeatable 1m prototype grid texture)** + **`bevy_egui`**. Includes exact OrlaBlocks theme & wordmark, `Viewport`-clipped central 3D canvas, interactive gizmo handles (`MoveXZ`, `East`, `West`, `North`, `South`, `HeightTop`), ground draw tools (`Room`, `Volume`, `Cylinder`, `Hole`), Outliner with hide/lock, Live Property Inspector, native `Open`/`Save JSON`, and collapsible Schema/`@skill`/`#tag` diagnostics.

### Package 3: `orla-math-geo` — Full 3D Gizmos, `i_overlay` Offsets, `parry3d` BVH & Curve/Point Editing
- `parry3d` BVH spatial index for $O(\log N)$ raycast picking and surface placement across 10,000+ shapes.
- `i_overlay` 2D polygon offsetting for arbitrary concave freeform rooms and nested footprints.
- Full 3D rotation/tilt/taper/bevel/wall-thickness gizmos, grid/vertex/edge snapping, and interactive 3D bezier/point editing on Freeforms, Ramps, and Lines.

### Package 4: `orla-tree-ops` — Groups, Entities & Live Arrays in 3D
- Hierarchical group transforms, Isolate mode, Entity definition editing, `wallAttachment` / `on` standing links (via `parry3d`), and live Path/Circle/Grid/Scatter array layouts rendered with Bevy instancing.

### Package 5: `orla-mesh-bake` — Manifold CSG Holes & glTF/Unity Export
- Manifold-grade parallel 3D boolean hole subtraction (`csgrs` / welded manifold CSG + `cutTags` + `cutTagParts`) with incremental dirty-graph caching and `.glb` (`gltf` crate) / Unity export.

### Package 6: `orla-terrain` — Multi-threaded 3D Heightfield & Modifiers
- Parallel `rayon` terrain evaluation, modifier blending (`raise`, `lower`, `set`, `fade`), and `parry3d` heightfield ray queries rendered natively in Bevy.

### Package 7: `orla-engine` — Undo/Redo History, Library Panel, Walk Mode & Shots
- Reversible command stack (`commit` + undo/redo), Library (`#tags`/`@skills`) editor, 3D Note pin placement/editing, First/Third-person `parry3d` Walk mode with slope/step climbing, and saved Shot captures.

### Package 8: `orla-server` — Built-in MCP Server & Workspace Persistence
- Background `axum`/`tokio` HTTP MCP server + workspace `.lock` & atomic disk persistence + offscreen Bevy render-to-image `render_view` inside the single native desktop binary.

